  "reference_caveats": [
    "CPU ratios are indicative, not like-for-like: the HeCBench OpenMP reference is an offload program (num_threads(256)) that oversubscribes 14 cores when run host-side.",
    "CUDA reference segfaults at 100M in the FP64 pass (it mallocs five host buffers of 2.4 GB without checking); 50M is used as the largest measured configuration",
